      "reason": "Make selection credible under the small, fixed validation sample and limited search budget.",
      "query": "How should sequential recommendation architecture ablations be compared using fixed sampled HR@10 with 200 validation users per category, four equally weighted categories, and 99 negatives per user? Investigate paired user-level bootstrap confidence intervals, category-stratified uncertainty, and validation overfitting from repeated hyperparameter and checkpoint selection."
